# Bugs & Support Patches
:::

:::shape id=0AgabY1uYm at=center width=480 height=400 offsetX=-256 offsetY=80 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::text id=Ne9x41mPVF at=center width=424 height=40 offsetX=-256 offsetY=-80 preset=caption align=center color=#991B1B
MY BUGS
:::

:::text id=Yl8YJN_BGm at=center width=424 height=216 offsetX=-256 offsetY=104 preset=body align=left color=text
• Ask many questions before committing
• Respond slowly on low energy
• Incoherent when over-excited
• Push myself & team too hard
:::

:::shape id=fMkVXfVUKi at=center width=480 height=400 offsetX=264 offsetY=80 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::text id=2eQymkRBoY at=center width=424 height=40 offsetX=264 offsetY=-80 preset=caption align=center color=#166534
HOW TO SUPPORT
:::

:::text id=w7jRvy5hJm at=center width=424 height=176 offsetX=264 offsetY=104 preset=body align=left color=text
• Provide context & business relevance
• Give time to recover (ping if urgent)
• Let things sink in & echo back ideas
• Explain if approach isn't working
:::
